"Zoning Milwaukee, Wisconsin 2026",,"This polygon data layer represents 148,087 zoning features in the City of Milwaukee, Wisconsin as accessed September 18, 2026. Zoning divides land into districts that regulate permitted land uses and the size, bulk, and placement of buildings. The source portal states that the dataset is refreshed nightly. The source shapefile is projected in NAD27 / Wisconsin South (EPSG:32054).",eng,City of Milwaukee Department of City Development,American Geographical Society Library – UWM Libraries,Datasets,Polygon data,Property,2026,2026,2026,Milwaukee|Wisconsin|United States,,"ENVELOPE(-88.077255,-87.859611,43.194861,42.919583)","ENVELOPE(-88.077255,-87.859611,43.194861,42.919583)","<a href=""https://uwm.edu/libraries/digital-collections/copyright-digcoll/"">Please see the UWM Libraries statement on Copyright and Digital Collections</a>.|Although this data is being distributed by the American Geographical Society Library at the University of Wisconsin-Milwaukee Libraries, no warranty expressed or implied is made by the University as to the accuracy of the data and related materials. The act of distribution shall not constitute any such warranty, and no responsibility is assumed by the University in the use of this data, or related materials.",Public,Shapefile,https://data.milwaukee.gov/dataset/zoning,https://data.milwaukee.gov/dataset/27a3101b-41ad-4c59-a1df-a161f80a7176/resource/434ddb25-6871-4835-b4c8-1298913df878/download/zoning.zip,,,,Aardvark,false,,,City of Milwaukee Department of City Development,Zoning|Land use regulation,,http://www.opendefinition.org/licenses/cc-by,https://city.milwaukee.gov/DCD/Planning/PlanningAdministration/Zoning,https://milwaukeemaps.milwaukee.gov/arcgis/rest/services/planning/zoning/MapServer/11,,
