"Neighborhood Strategic Planning Areas Milwaukee, Wisconsin 2026",,"This polygon data layer represents two City of Milwaukee Neighborhood Strategic Planning areas, also identified by the associated service as Neighborhood Revitalization Strategy Areas, as accessed September 18, 2026. The source portal states that the dataset is refreshed nightly. The source shapefile is projected in NAD27 / Wisconsin South (EPSG:32054).",eng,City of Milwaukee Department of Administration,American Geographical Society Library – UWM Libraries,Datasets,Polygon data,Economy|Property|Society,2026,2026,2026,Milwaukee|Wisconsin|United States,,"ENVELOPE(-88.029972,-87.889669,43.136664,42.991295)","ENVELOPE(-88.029972,-87.889669,43.136664,42.991295)","<a href=""https://uwm.edu/libraries/digital-collections/copyright-digcoll/"">Please see the UWM Libraries statement on Copyright and Digital Collections</a>.|Although this data is being distributed by the American Geographical Society Library at the University of Wisconsin-Milwaukee Libraries, no warranty expressed or implied is made by the University as to the accuracy of the data and related materials. The act of distribution shall not constitute any such warranty, and no responsibility is assumed by the University in the use of this data, or related materials.",Public,Shapefile,https://data.milwaukee.gov/dataset/neighborhood-strategic-planning-areas-nsp,https://data.milwaukee.gov/dataset/22362669-ecff-43e4-a7ce-9cdb0c7c90b4/resource/74b4e27d-b713-4b30-9c99-ebdfc0c802a1/download/cdga_nsp.zip,,,,Aardvark,false,,"Neighborhood Revitalization Strategy Areas Milwaukee, Wisconsin 2026",City of Milwaukee Department of Administration,Neighborhood planning|Community development|Strategic planning areas,,http://www.opendefinition.org/licenses/cc-by,https://city.milwaukee.gov/CommunityDevelopment310.htm,https://milwaukeemaps.milwaukee.gov/arcgis/rest/services/planning/special_districts/MapServer/21,,
